/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store
/node_modules
/dist

# `tools/oracle` is deliberately outside the workspace (see its README), so its
# build artefacts are not covered by the `/target` line above. Its lock file is
# not committed because it resolves against a sibling checkout of
# `data-modelling-sdk` and would churn with that repository rather than with
# this one; what pins the oracle for reproducibility is the SDK commit recorded
# inside each generated verdicts file.
/tools/oracle/target
/tools/oracle/Cargo.lock
